<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the</p>
<p>Kremlin Cup men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>David Prinosil (Germany) beat Andrei Olkhovsky 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-2</p>
<p>Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) 6-3 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
<p>2-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Peter Korda (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>7-5 6-0</p>
</text>
